our stats and unlock more eligible walking time.\n\nbut shoes wear out.\nwalk too much and durability drops.\nrepair them.\nupgrade them.\nfind better ones.\ntrade them.\nbuild your setup.\nenergy refills over time, so nobody can just walk for 14 hours and farm the entire pool.\nthe target is simple:\n10,000 steps a day.\nthe more real revenue the protocol generates, the bigger the pool can become.\n\ninstead of sitting inside farming imaginary yield, we're making people go outside and compete through actual work.\nmove-to-earn is coming back.\nthis time, touch grass.\n$STEPN","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://stepinu.com/"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/Stepinudotcom"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/b1cy3bdndmtnf5cyp1b4u6eslazbh8svnwx4uxapzdkt","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"B1cY3bdnDMTNF5CYP1b4u6ESLazbh8SvnWX4uxApzDKT","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/jO4megS8R0uPf3Ni?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/FlDmgWbCIFa4pk13?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/B1cY3bdnDMTNF5CYP1b4u6ESLazbh8SvnWX4uxApzDKT?timestamp=1790809200000","description":"Plinko, but fully onchain.\n\nEvery $10 of your buy drop a ball automatically.\n\nEvery ball can win a % of the reward pool.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://pumpball.wtf/"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/pumpballwtf"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/b8uc5gm1hmctpkptuj9v4qvvdiakrjlmrdwerh6bpump","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"B8UC5gM1hMCtPKPTUj9V4qvvDiakRJLmRDWerH6Bpump","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/J6loVZaDPHbd-pLu?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/hCnm5kH64P7TERxX?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/B8UC5gM1hMCtPKPTUj9V